          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "加强或减弱红原色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strengthens quiet colors more than colors that are already strong, and protects skin tones.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对较淡的颜色加强得更多，并保护肤色。"
