          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text Editing": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text Size": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text color": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text fields keep standard macOS editing keys. Dialogs share the Apply/Cancel assignments above. Numeric fields use Up/Down, with Shift for larger steps. Standard macOS commands include ⌘Q to quit and ⌃⌘F for full screen. The shortcut editor itself always uses Return to save and Esc to cancel when not recording.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本栏保留标准 macOS 编辑键。对话框共用上方的应用/取消指定。数字栏使用上/下方向键，Shift 用于更大的步进。标准 macOS 命令包括 ⌘Q 退出和 ⌃⌘F 全屏。快捷键编辑器在未录制时始终用 Return 存储、用 Esc 取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text · Double-click to edit": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字 · 连按两下以编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text-editing shortcuts need Command, Option, or Control so they do not replace normal typing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字编辑快捷键需要包含 Command、Option 或 Control，以免取代正常键入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Texture": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "纹理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That selection is too detailed to outline. Try a different Tolerance, or turn on Contiguous.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该选区过于细致，无法勾勒。请尝试其他容差，或打开“连续”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That shape is too large. A shape can cover up to %lld megapixels.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该形状太大。一个形状最多可以覆盖 %lld 百万像素。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That text box exceeds the %@-pixel or %lld-megapixel limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该文本框超过了 %@ 像素或 %lld 百万像素的限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The 2012 response. Calibration reaches most of the strength used by Version 6.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2012 年的响应。校准能达到版本 6 所用强度的大部分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Photoshop file could not be read. It may be damaged or incomplete.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取该 Photoshop 文件。它可能已损坏或不完整。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Photoshop stroke isn’t supported on shape layers and was omitted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "形状图层不支持 Photoshop 描边，已省略。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Photoshop text warp was omitted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已省略 Photoshop 文字变形。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The brush trails the pointer on a string this long, so a shaky hand still draws a smooth line": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画笔在这么长的一段距离上跟随指针，因此手抖时仍能画出平滑的线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The canvas could not be rendered. Try a smaller canvas.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法渲染画布。请尝试更小的画布。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The characters to draw with, in any order: each spot gets the one whose ink best matches its tone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用来绘制的字符，顺序不限：每个位置使用油墨最接近其色调的那个字符"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The copied layers exceed this project’s %lld-megapixel limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拷贝的图层超过了此项目 %lld 百万像素的限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The font “%@” isn’t installed, so the text was drawn with the system font.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未安装字体“%@”，因此文字使用了系统字体。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The height of each line of characters": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每行字符的高度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The image could not be encoded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法编码该图像。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The image could not be read. It may be damaged or unavailable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取该图像。它可能已损坏或不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The layer mask couldn’t be converted to 8-bit grayscale and was skipped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图层蒙版无法转换为 8 位灰度，已跳过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The layer mask is turned off. Shift-click its thumbnail to turn it on, then paint.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图层蒙版已关闭。按住 Shift 点按其缩览图以打开，然后再绘画。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The object mask could not be rendered.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法渲染对象蒙版。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The smart object was rasterized. Linked contents can’t be edited.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "智能对象已栅格化。无法编辑链接的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The trimmed image dimensions are invalid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "裁切后的图像尺寸无效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There isn’t enough memory to make that selection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内存不足，无法建立该选区。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Layer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前图层"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Photoshop file uses a format version Compositor can’t read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Photoshop 文件使用的格式版本 Compositor 无法读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Photoshop file uses a layer compression method that isn’t supported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Photoshop 文件使用了不受支持的图层压缩方法。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Photoshop layer type isn’t supported and was imported as pixels.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不支持此 Photoshop 图层类型，已导入为像素。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This adjustment type isn’t supported and was skipped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不支持此调整类型，已跳过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This clipping mask’s base isn’t supported, so clipping was skipped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不支持此剪贴蒙版的基底，已跳过剪贴。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This import exceeds the current %lld-megapixel document budget or %@-pixel side limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此次导入超过了当前 %lld 百万像素的文档预算或 %@ 像素的边长限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is not a valid Compositor project, or its metadata is damaged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这不是有效的 Compositor 项目，或其元数据已损坏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This project exceeds the supported canvas, layer, file-size, or %lld-megapixel document limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此项目超过了支持的画布、图层、文件大小或 %lld 百万像素文档限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This project uses format version %lld. This app supports versions %lld–%lld.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此项目使用格式版本 %lld。此应用支持版本 %lld–%lld。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three-Way": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "三向"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three-Way shows shadows, midtones, and highlights. The other choices show one wheel.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "三向同时显示阴影、中间调和高光。其他选项只显示一个色轮。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tint": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色调"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Toggle Clipping Mask": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换剪贴蒙版"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Toggle Levels preview": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换色阶预览"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tolerance": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "容差"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tonal Contrast": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色调对比度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tones": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色调"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tones from black on the left to white on the right: blacks, shadows, midtones, highlights, whites. Control-click to show the vectorscope.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色调从左端的黑到右端的白：黑色、阴影、中间调、高光、白色。按住 Control 点按以显示矢量示波器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tones per channel: 2 is pure black and white": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每通道色调数：2 为纯黑白"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tool › Blur": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工具 › 模糊"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tool › Brush": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工具 › 画笔"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tool › Clone Stamp": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工具 › 仿制图章"
          }
        }
